#: ui.py:266
msgid "A 1-part mold has nothing to clamp"
msgstr "单部分模具无需夹紧"

#: properties.py:296
msgid "A channel runs down a split plane beside the part and enters it low on its side: it fills from below (fewer bubbles, the air leaves through the vents on top) and the mark is on the seam the mold leaves anyway"
msgstr "流道沿零件旁的分型面向下延伸，从侧面低处进入：从下方填充（气泡更少，空气从顶部排气孔排出），且痕迹位于模具本就留下的接缝上"

#: properties.py:255
msgid "Add pegs and holes to align the mold parts"
msgstr "添加定位销和孔以对齐模具各部分"

#: operators.py:191
msgid "Air vent (stays on the object)"
msgstr "排气孔（保留在物体上）"

#: properties.py:437
msgid "Also export the (oriented, repaired) master on its own, e.g. to print it separately"
msgstr "同时单独导出（已定向、已修复的）母模，例如单独打印"

