msgstr "封堵块厚度"

#: operators.py:189
msgid "Bolt"
msgstr "螺栓"

#: properties.py:106
msgid "Bolt Diameter"
msgstr "螺栓直径"

#: properties.py:106
msgid "Bolt size for the clamping tabs (3 = M3); zip ties also fit through the holes"
msgstr "夹紧凸耳所用螺栓尺寸（3 = M3）；孔中也可穿扎带"

#: operators.py:189
msgid "Bolt that clamps the parts together (stays on the split plane)"
msgstr "将各部分夹紧的螺栓（位于分型面上）"

#: properties.py:348
msgid "Boolean Solver"
msgstr "布尔求解器"

#: preview.py:545
msgid "Build the real mold at a coarse resolution shortly after each change, in its own collection (not saved with the file). Generate Mold makes the final one"
msgstr "每次更改后不久以粗略分辨率在独立集合中构建实际模具（不随文件保存）。「生成模具」会生成最终版本"

#: properties.py:166
msgid "Build the shell and silicone surfaces with big faces where they are nearly flat: about 20 times fewer faces and much faster, with ~0.1 mm of error. Disable for the exact voxel surface"
msgstr "在近乎平坦处用大面构建壳体和硅胶表面：面数约减少 20 倍且快得多，误差约 0.1 毫米。禁用可获得精确的体素表面"

#: operators.py:432
msgid "Built-in presets can't be removed (only the ones you saved)"
msgstr "内置预设无法删除（仅可删除你自己保存的预设）"

#: ui.py:363
msgid "Cache"
msgstr "缓存"

#: operators.py:73
msgid "Cancelled"
msgstr "已取消"

#: properties.py:390
msgid "Cast Density"
msgstr "浇注料密度"

#: properties.py:396
msgid "Cast Price / kg"
msgstr "浇注料价格 / kg"

#: properties.py:94
msgid "Clamping"
msgstr "夹紧"

#: properties.py:65
msgid "Clean"
msgstr "清理"

#: properties.py:66
msgid "Clean, then rebuild a watertight surface with voxels (for broken or self-intersecting meshes; uses the Resolution setting)"
msgstr "清理，然后用体素重建封闭表面（用于破损或自交的网格；使用「分辨率」设置）"

#: properties.py:273
msgid "Clearance added to the key holes so printed parts fit"
msgstr "为定位孔增加的间隙，以便打印件配合"

#: properties.py:111
msgid "Clip Size"
msgstr "卡扣尺寸"

#: properties.py:99
msgid "Clips"
msgstr "卡扣"

#: properties.py:72
msgid "Close holes that go right through the object (handles, rings) with a thin wall, so the silicone doesn't lock around them. Trim the thin flash off the casts afterwards"
msgstr "用薄壁封住贯穿物体的孔（把手、环），以免硅胶卡住其中。浇注后修剪掉薄飞边"

#: properties.py:195
msgid "Closest distance between the objects' surfaces (mold material between their cavities, at least 1 mm). In a shell mold, between their silicone layers: 0 = the silicone of one touches the silicone of the next; negative = they share silicone, down to minus the silicone thickness"
msgstr "物体表面之间的最近距离（型腔之间的模具材料，至少 1 毫米）。在壳体模具中为硅胶层之间的距离：0 = 一个的硅胶接触下一个的硅胶；负值 = 共用硅胶，最低为负的硅胶厚度"

#: properties.py:89
msgid "Color the layout master: green releases, yellow has no draft, red is an undercut"
msgstr "为布局母模着色：绿色可脱模，黄色无拔模角，红色为倒扣"

#: properties.py:264
msgid "Cone-shaped pegs, easier to fit and print"
msgstr "锥形定位销，更易配合和打印"

#: properties.py:210
msgid "Core"
msgstr "型芯"

#: properties.py:217
msgid "Curved Parting"
msgstr "曲面分型"

#: properties.py:279
msgid "Cut a pouring hole on the split line at the highest point, and air vents at other high points"
msgstr "在最高处的分型线上切出浇注孔，并在其他高点切出排气孔"

#: properties.py:414
msgid "Cut pieces that don't fit the bed (as they will be printed) in halves, with holes for 1.75 mm filament pins to line them up when gluing"
msgstr "将放不下打印床的部件（按打印方向）切成两半，并留出 1.75 毫米耗材销孔以便粘合时对齐"

#: properties.py:364
msgid "Density"
msgstr "密度"

#: properties.py:364
msgid "Density of the mixed silicone (g/ml); most are 1.05 - 1.2"
msgstr "混合硅胶密度（g/ml）；大多为 1.05 - 1.2"

#: properties.py:390
msgid "Density of what will be cast in the silicone mold (wax ~0.9, soap ~1.05, resin ~1.1, plaster ~1.6 g/ml)"
msgstr "将在硅胶模具中浇铸材料的密度（蜡约 0.9，肥皂约 1.05，树脂约 1.1，石膏约 1.6 g/ml）"

#: properties.py:406
msgid "Depth of the printer's build plate"
msgstr "打印机打印平台的深度"

#: properties.py:83
msgid "Dimples on the inside of the shell: the silicone fills them and always sits back in the exact same place"
msgstr "壳体内侧的凹坑：硅胶会填满它们，并总能回到完全相同的位置"

#: properties.py:26
msgid "Direct Mold (Cast Part)"
msgstr "直接模具（浇铸件）"

#: preview.py:540
msgid "Draw the mold in the viewport as you change the settings or the layout: outline, split planes, keys, bolts, pour holes and vents (red: pieces too big for the bed). Nothing is added to the scene"
msgstr "更改设置或布局时，在视图中绘制模具：轮廓、分模面、键、螺栓、浇注孔和排气孔（红色：超出打印平台的部件）。不会向场景添加任何内容"

#: ui.py:31
#: ui.py:176
msgid "EasyMold"
msgstr "EasyMold"

#: properties.py:100
msgid "Elastic Bands"
msgstr "橡皮筋"

#: ui.py:368
msgid "Empty"
msgstr "空物体"

#: properties.py:324
msgid "Entry Tip"
msgstr "入口尖端"

#: properties.py:352
msgid "Exact"
msgstr "精确"

#: ui.py:415
msgid "Export"
msgstr "导出"

#: properties.py:386
msgid "Extra"
msgstr "额外"

#: properties.py:386
msgid "Extra to mix for what stays in the cup and on the stick"
msgstr "额外混合量（留在杯中与搅拌棒上的）"

#: ui.py:246
msgid "Fast"
msgstr "快速"

#: properties.py:166
msgid "Fast Surfaces"
msgstr "快速曲面"

#: properties.py:225
msgid "Find the hollows of the part that the opened block can't let go of (like the inside of a sock) and make a printed core for each, flush with the outside of the block and held by key pegs. Needs a mold in 2 or 4 parts; not used when a Core object is set"
msgstr "找出打开后的模块无法脱模的零件凹陷处（例如袜子内侧），为每处制作打印芯块，与模块外侧齐平并用键销固定。需要 2 或 4 件模具；设置 Core 物体时不使用"

#: properties.py:61
msgid "Fix the copy of the object used for the mold (the original is never modified)"
msgstr "修复用于模具的物体副本（原物体不会被修改）"

#: properties.py:178
msgid "Flange Thickness"
msgstr "法兰厚度"

#: properties.py:172
msgid "Flange Width"
msgstr "法兰宽度"

#: properties.py:99
msgid "Flanges along the splits and around the base to grip with binder clips"
msgstr "沿分模线和底座周围增加法兰，便于用长尾夹夹紧"

#: properties.py:135
msgid "Flat Pour Opening"
msgstr "平坦浇注口"

#: properties.py:430
msgid "Folder"
msgstr "文件夹"

#: properties.py:422
msgid "Format"
msgstr "格式"

#: ui.py:328
msgid "Funnel Depth"
msgstr "漏斗深度"

#: ui.py:395
msgid "Generate the mold to see the amounts"
msgstr "生成模具以查看用量"

#: properties.py:190
msgid "Grid"
msgstr "网格"

#: properties.py:100
msgid "Grooves that keep rubber bands in place (box and direct molds; can't hold the base of a shell mold)"
msgstr "固定橡皮筋的凹槽（盒式模具和直接模具；无法固定壳式模具的底座）"

#: properties.py:263
msgid "Half-sphere bumps"
msgstr "半球凸点"

#: properties.py:410
msgid "Height"
msgstr "高度"

#: properties.py:48
msgid "Height of the lip/groove that aligns the walls with the base"
msgstr "使侧壁与底座对齐的凸边/凹槽高度"

#: properties.py:161
msgid "Height of the parting line, from the bottom (0%) to the top (100%) of the master"
msgstr "分模线高度，从母模底部（0%）到顶部（100%）"

#: properties.py:141
msgid "Height of the pour plug between the base and the object"
msgstr "底座与物体之间浇注塞的高度"

#: properties.py:304
msgid "How far the funnel rises above the mold (0 = funnel cut into the mold surface)"
msgstr "漏斗高出模具的距离（0 = 漏斗切入模具表面）"

#: properties.py:122
msgid "How much the cast material shrinks as it sets: the master is enlarged so the copies come out at the original size (resin ~0.5-2%, wax ~1-3%, silicone ~0.1%). Recreate the layout after changing it"
msgstr "浇铸材料固化时的收缩率：母模会放大，使副本保持原始尺寸（树脂约 0.5-2%，蜡约 1-3%，硅胶约 0.1%）。更改后请重新创建布局"

#: properties.py:185
msgid "How several selected objects are placed in one mold (the active object stays where it is)"
msgstr "多个选中物体在一个模具中的排列方式（活动物体保持原位）"

#: properties.py:94
msgid "How the mold parts are held together (and to the base) while the material cures"
msgstr "材料固化时模具各部分如何固定在一起（以及固定到底座）"

#: properties.py:336
msgid "How the vents go up from the part (direct mold)"
msgstr "排气孔从零件向上延伸的方式（直接模具）"

#: properties.py:135
msgid "If the bottom of the object is not flat, add a pour plug under it so it prints flat on the base and leaves a flat pour opening in the silicone"
msgstr "如果物体底部不平，在其下方添加浇注塞，使其平贴在底座上打印，并在硅胶中留下平坦的浇注口"

#: properties.py:190
msgid "In a compact grid (molds that are not split; otherwise a row)"
msgstr "紧凑网格排列（未分割的模具；否则排成一行）"

#: properties.py:437
msgid "Include Master"
msgstr "包含母模"

#: properties.py:53
msgid "Join the object to the base so master and base print as one piece. Disable it to glue a physical original instead. The face on -Z becomes the pour opening. 2-part mold: print the master with its sprue and vents attached (disabled: only the sprue and vents, to glue onto the original)"
msgstr "将物体与底座合并，使母模和底座作为一件打印。禁用后可改为粘接实体原型。-Z 方向的面成为浇注口。2 件模具：打印带浇道和排气孔的母模（禁用时：仅打印浇道和排气孔，用于粘到原型上）"

