msgstr "单个文件，所有部件排布在底板上（毫米）"

#: properties.py:210
msgid "Optional mesh that fills the hollow inside the part (e.g. a heater block shape). It becomes a separate printed core; let it stick out of the block so it can be held"
msgstr "可选网格，用于填充部件内部的空腔（例如加热块形状）。它会成为独立的打印型芯；让其伸出块体以便拿取"

